  <name>sevenx_payment_stripe</name>
  <summary>7x Payment Gateway : Stripe</summary>
  <description>Stripe Payment Element gateway for eZ Publish 4 / Exponential CMS. Integrates the Stripe PaymentIntents API and Stripe.js Payment Element into the eZ Publish shop workflow. Supports cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Link, Stripe Tax, and all Stripe-enabled payment methods.</description>
